@startuml
title Сценарий с ошибкой: Notification Service недоступен

actor "Студент" as Student
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Course Service" as CourseSvc
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "Event Bus\n(RabbitMQ)" as Bus
participant "Notification\nWorker" as NotifyWorker
participant "Push Service\n(Firebase)" as Push

note over Student, Push
  Студент сдал тест.
  Система пытается отправить уведомление.
end note

Student -> Gateway: POST /api/tests/submit\n{course_id: "C-101", answers: [...]}
activate Gateway

Gateway -> CourseSvc: Пересылка запроса
activate CourseSvc

CourseSvc -> CourseSvc: Валидация ответов\nи расчёт баллов

CourseSvc -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB

CourseSvc -> DB: UPDATE progress\nSET status='COMPLETED', score=80%
DB --> CourseSvc: OK

CourseSvc -> DB: INSERT test_result\n(score=80%, attempts=1)
DB --> CourseSvc: OK

CourseSvc -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> CourseSvc: Committed
deactivate DB

note over CourseSvc
  Тест принят. Прогресс сохранён.
  Генерация события асинхронна.
end note

CourseSvc -> Bus: publish(CourseCompleted,\nuser_id='U-42', badge='B-01')
activate Bus
Bus --> CourseSvc: ACK
deactivate Bus

CourseSvc --> Gateway: 200 OK\n{score: "80%", passed: true}
deactivate CourseSvc

Gateway --> Student: 200 OK\n"Курс пройден!"
deactivate Gateway

== Асинхронная обработка уведомлений ==

Bus -> NotifyWorker: consume(CourseCompleted)
activate NotifyWorker

NotifyWorker -> NotifyWorker: Формирование\nсписка уведомлений

NotifyWorker -> Push: sendPush(user_id,\n"Поздравляем! Вы прошли курс.")
activate Push

note over Push
  Push Service недоступен!
  Connection timeout 10s
end note

Push --> NotifyWorker: Timeout Exception
deactivate Push

NotifyWorker -> NotifyWorker: Обработка ошибки:\n- НЕ откатываем прогресс\n- Помещаем в retry queue

NotifyWorker -> DB: INSERT INTO notification_queue\n(user_id='U-42', status='pending',\nretry_count=0, next_retry_at=NOW()+5min)
activate DB
DB --> NotifyWorker: OK
deactivate DB

NotifyWorker -> Bus: publish(NotificationFailed,\nuser_id='U-42', reason='Push timeout')
activate Bus
Bus --> NotifyWorker: ACK
deactivate Bus

note over NotifyWorker
  Ожидание повторной попытки...
  (Задержка 5 минут)
end note

NotifyWorker -> DB: SELECT * FROM notification_queue\nWHERE status='pending'\nAND next_retry_at <= NOW()
activate DB
DB --> NotifyWorker: 1 запись\n(user_id='U-42')
deactivate DB

NotifyWorker -> Push: sendPush(user_id, ...)
activate Push
Push --> NotifyWorker: Message-ID: msg-456\nStatus: sent
deactivate Push

NotifyWorker -> DB: UPDATE notification_queue\nSET status='delivered',\ndelivered_at=NOW()
activate DB
DB --> NotifyWorker: OK
deactivate DB

note over NotifyWorker
  Уведомление доставлено успешно!
end note

deactivate NotifyWorker

@enduml